 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Every night,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 0.569
  },
  {
   "text": "a quiet worker sneaks onto the runway with a cart full of gray blocks.",
   "s": 0.814,
   "e": 4.297
  },
  {
   "text": "At the very end,",
   "s": 4.785,
   "e": 5.485
  },
  {
   "text": "right before a giant cliff,",
   "s": 5.739,
   "e": 7.115
  },
  {
   "text": "he lays them down one by one.",
   "s": 7.4,
   "e": 8.839
  },
  {
   "text": "But these blocks are weak.",
   "s": 9.518,
   "e": 10.535
  },
  {
   "text": "Step on one, and it crumbles like a cookie.",
   "s": 10.893,
   "e": 12.906
  },
  {
   "text": "A truck rolls over them, and its wheels sink right in.",
   "s": 13.432,
   "e": 15.84
  },
  {
   "text": "The airport boss sees it and turns bright red.",
   "s": 16.428,
   "e": 18.538
  },
  {
   "text": "\"You put garbage at the end of my runway?",
   "s": 19.024,
   "e": 21.061
  },
  {
   "text": "A plane hits this and people die!\"",
   "s": 21.403,
   "e": 23.171
  },
  {
   "text": "He slams a sign into the ground:",
   "s": 23.65,
   "e": 25.177
  },
  {
   "text": "\"RIP IT OUT.",
   "s": 25.541,
   "e": 26.751
  },
  {
   "text": "MONDAY 8 AM.\"",
   "s": 26.978,
   "e": 27.957
  },
  {
   "text": "But on Sunday,",
   "s": 28.607,
   "e": 29.274
  },
  {
   "text": "a passenger jet lands too fast in the rain.",
   "s": 29.464,
   "e": 31.499
  },
  {
   "text": "Its brakes scream.",
   "s": 31.902,
   "e": 33.001
  },
  {
   "text": "The runway runs out.",
   "s": 33.36,
   "e": 34.325
  },
  {
   "text": "The cliff gets closer.",
   "s": 34.659,
   "e": 35.749
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the wheels hit the soft blocks.",
   "s": 36.175,
   "e": 38.215
  },
  {
   "text": "Crunch.",
   "s": 38.54,
   "e": 39.049
  },
  {
   "text": "Crunch.",
   "s": 39.307,
   "e": 39.821
  },
  {
   "text": "Crunch.",
   "s": 40.053,
   "e": 40.615
  },
  {
   "text": "The jet sinks deeper with every row,",
   "s": 41.162,
   "e": 42.958
  },
  {
   "text": "slower and slower,",
   "s": 43.275,
   "e": 44.477
  },
  {
   "text": "until it stops just three feet from the edge.",
   "s": 44.765,
   "e": 46.934
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 47.483,
   "e": 47.837
  },
  {
   "text": "this crushable concrete is built to break.",
   "s": 48.017,
   "e": 50.184
  },
  {
   "text": "Every block that crumbles under the wheels eats up the plane's speed,",
   "s": 50.642,
   "e": 54.724
  },
  {
   "text": "like a giant sponge.",
   "s": 55.17,
   "e": 55.658
  },
  {
   "text": "It's called EMAS,",
   "s": 55.792,
   "e": 56.841
  },
  {
   "text": "and real airports use it today.",
   "s": 57.024,
   "e": 58.369
  },
  {
   "text": "On Monday,",
   "s": 59.069,
   "e": 59.601
  },
  {
   "text": "the demolition crew shows up and finds a jet sitting in the blocks.",
   "s": 59.789,
   "e": 63.214
  },
  {
   "text": "So the boss tears up the sign, and orders more garbage.",
   "s": 63.371,
   "e": 65.76
  }
